
Ryoku @RYOKU_NAME@ @RYOKU_VERSION@ Void installer (live)  (@RYOKU_COMMIT@)

The graphical installer starts automatically on tty1. The serial and secondary
consoles remain root recovery shells. Run `ryoku-install` there for unattended
or manual installs; the payload is under /usr/share/ryoku.

The offline package repository is mounted from the ISO at
/run/initramfs/live/ryoku/repo.
